// Water_DX90 (Water_DX9_HDR in HDR). The expensive pass (water_ps20b /
// water_vs20): the bump-perturbed reflection and refraction textures blended by
// the Fresnel term of the tangent-space eye vector (brush tangents), the
// refraction fogged above water by its depth alpha or below water by the
// projected depth, the 5x5 blurred refraction, the scrolled multitexture
// normals, and the base texture times the bumped lightmaps (uv1 stepped by
// uv2). The cheap pass (watercheap_ps20b / watercheap_vs20) blends the cube
// map reflection by the Fresnel and distance factor, faded by the refraction's
// depth alpha. The opaque cheap pass ($forcecheap) normalizes through the
// material system's signed normalization cube map. In HDR LoadCubeMap loads
// the cube map's ".hdr" name.
